---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="News & Events">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>News & Events</h1>
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href={base}>Home</a> / News & Events</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        Stay updated with the latest news, events, and developments from the SCAN II project.
      </p>

      <div class="news-item">
        <h2>Final Conference SCAN II Project</h2>
        <p class="event-date">22-23 February 2024 | Brussels, Belgium</p>

        <p>
          The Final Conference of the SCAN II Project marked the culmination of our journey with groundbreaking
          discussions and insights. This event highlighted the possibility to ensure consumer's access to justice
          in small claims proceedings through an innovative digital platform.
        </p>

        <div class="event-details">
          <p><strong>Location:</strong> European Committee of the Regions, Rue Belliard 101; Hoek 38, Rue de Louvain 38, Brussels</p>
        </div>

        <p>
          The conference featured an incredible lineup of speakers including Kim Van der Borght, Paul Nemitz,
          Rimantas Simaitis, Milda Markevičiūtė, Tatjana Josipovic, Thomas Hoffmann, Paola Giacalone,
          Stefano Menini, Nadia Mana, Paola Pendenza, Maria Dymitruk, Alina Ontanu, Francesca Medda,
          Annapaola Voto, Nicolas Kyriakides, Michele Angelo Lupoi, Fulvio Maria Palombino, Stefaan Voet,
          Pietro Ortolani, Marco Farina, Alan Uzelac, Magdalena Jankowska-Gilberg, Rhonson Salim,
          Elena D'Alessandro, Tatjana Zoroska Kamilovska, Daša Tičar, Lana Gotvan, Clémence Dossier,
          Gioia Arnone, Seun Lari-Williams, Jachin Van Doninck, Gina Gioia, Sajedeh Salehi, Marco Giacalone,
          and many more experts in the field.
        </p>

        <p>
          This was an unparalleled opportunity to engage with experts and enthusiasts alike, share knowledge,
          and network with leaders in the field of digitalization of justice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="news-item">
        <h2>Final Conference Video</h2>
        <p>
          Watch the recording of the SCAN II Project Final Conference:
        </p>
        <div class="video-container">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/u6mJtTJMBbY"
            title="FINAL CONFERENCE SCAN 2 PROJECT"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            allowfullscreen>
          </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="news-item">
        <h2>SCAN2 Platform Launch</h2>
        <p>
          The SCAN2 e-platform is now available, providing comprehensive information on enforcement
          procedures across EU Member States.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://portal.scan2.vub.be" class="btn btn-accent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Access SCAN2 Platform</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .news-item {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .news-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .news-item h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .event-date {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .event-details {
    background: var(--color-background-alt);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .event-details p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .event-details p:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .event-details p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }

  .video-container iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }
</style>
